and ELF library formats.

For end users, Motif 2.0 improves their interface 
performance. The virtual screen support unclutters their 
workspace by providing alternate locations for chosen 
windows, while providing greater consistency with PC 
environments.

Metro Link's Motif is derived from OSF/Motif under 
license from OSF. In addition, Metro Link has a full 
support contract with OSF.


=== FEATURES ===

The new features of Motif 2.0 are:

 *  An extensibility framework to ease application and 
    widget development. 

 *  Compliance with the Common Desktop Environment (CDE) 
    and IEEE 1295. 

 *  Convergence with PC styles including seven new widgets.

 *  Support for desktop infrastructures such as virtual 
    window management and workspace management. 

 *  Numerous toolkit enhancements including a Uniform Transfer 
    Model (UTM) for simplified data transfer. 

 *  UIL improvements which include 64-bit support, platform 
    independent uid files and support of extensibility features.

As in earlier releases, Motif 2.0 offers:

 *  A common user interface across a wide range of applications 
    and platforms.

 *  Easy-to-use PC windowing-style interactive behavior, providing 
    users with rapid skill transfer. 

 *  Distinctive 3-D bevelled user interface elements. 

 *  A single, stable, widely available application programming 
    interface (API) allowing application developers to "write it 
    once" for many platforms. 

 *  A superior set of tools offering high developer productivity 
    in establishing a consistent look and feel. 

 *  Internationalization, easing access to worldwide markets.

 *  Hardware independence for scalability across all types of 
    operating and file systems. 

 *  Network transparency based on the X Window System.


=== THE METRO LINK DIFFERENCE ===

Metro Link provides reliable, high-quality products. In this 
release of Motif 2.0 our team of developers located and 
fixed numerous bugs in the source code, some of which 
were fatal. We've also made our release compliant with the 
Linux Filesystem Structure Standard. 

Additionally, we've added Pixmap Tools to the package to 
enhance the color pixmap support of Motif 2.0. These tools 
include a pixmap browser, a pixmap editor, and a large 
selection of premade color pixmaps. Simply set resources to 
display color icons, labels, and buttons within your 
applications. Create your own icons or edit the samples 
with the Motif-based pixmap editor. The xbmbrowser 
utility displays a whole directory of pixmaps 
simultaneously, which makes finding just the right image 
easy and enjoyable.

As always, Metro Link software comes with 90 days of free 
technical support (via phone, fax, or email) and a 30-day 
money-back guarantee.


=== WHAT'S INCLUDED ===

The Metro Link port of Motif 2.0 includes all of the 
following:

1) Motif Window Manager (mwm)

2) Shared Motif Widget Library (libXm.so.2.0 and libXm.sa)

3) Motif Demos

4) Static Motif Widget Library

5) Static Mrm and UIL Libraries

6) UIL Compiler

7) Motif Header Files 

8) Manual Pages for Motif Function Calls

9) Imakefile Support

10) Source to OSF/Motif Demos

11) Over 400 quality color pixmaps, most with transparent 
    backgrounds

12) Pixmap Editor

13) Xbmbrowser Utility


=== SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS ===

HARDWARE REQUIREMENTS

The full installation of Metro Link Motif 2.0 requires 30 megabytes 
of disk space, or 20 MB if you compress the man pages. 8 MB of 
RAM is required. 16 MB or more are recommended.

SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS

You need tar, cpio, and gzip to extract the distribution. You need 
Linux 0.99 pl 15g or above, libc 4.5.26 or above, ld.so.1.4.3 or above, 
and XFree86 3.1.1 or above. You need gcc 2.5.8 or above to compile
programs. You must have the X libraries from XFree86 3.1.1 or above.


=== DISTRIBUTION OPTIONS ===

CD-ROM
Motif 2.0 is distributed on CD with installation instructions, 
release notes, and one bound volume of the OSF/Motif User's 
Guide. Three OSF manuals are included on the CD in postscript
format.  These are: The OSF/Motif User's Guide, the OSF/Motif 
Programmer's Guide, and the OSF/Motif Widget Writer's Guide. 
Shipping charges are additional.

INTERNET FTP
For fastest delivery and no shipping charges, Motif 2.0 is 
also available via FTP from the Metro Link internet site. 
With a credit card payment, the FTP instructions are 
usually emailed on the same day the order is received. With 
