manuals from the FTP site: The OSF/Motif User's Guide, 
the OSF/Motif Programmer's Guide, and the OSF/Motif 
Widget Writer's Guide. 

DISKETTES
Motif 2.0 is distributed on five floppy disks with installation 
instructions, release notes, and one bound volume of the 
OSF/Motif User's Guide. Shipping charges are additional.


