month at Taki's Pizza, 7729 24th Avenue NW, in Loyal Heights.  The May
meeting will be held May 20th at 7PM.

The meetings are informal and open to everyone.  Typically the meetings
start with a speaker and end with a question and answer period.  Food is
available starting at 6PM.  While you are not required to purchase any food
you'll probably want to as the portions are huge, the prices are reasonable
and the food is delicious.

