Linux-FT POSIX certified, a new InfoMagic CD set available and lots of other
distribution news we thought a distribution comparison would be of value.
Linux Journal is in the process of putting together a comparison and Bryan
Philippe is doing the work.  Bryan has agreed to present his preliminary
findings and answer questions.  So, come with your favorite "which is
better" questions and see if Bryan (or anyone else at the meeting) has the
right answers.

