You need an ELF based system with X11 and a printer that supports PJL,
eg one of the following:
        LaserJet IIISi, 4Si, 4SiMx, 4V, 4MV
        LaserJet 4, 4 Plus, 4M, 4M Plus, 4L, 4ML, 4P, 4MP, 4PJ
        LaserJet 5
        Color LaserJet 
        DeskJet 1200C and DesignJet Family
        PaintJet XL300


