Stella 96 is an Atari 2600 emulator.  Currently, it is a work-in-progress and
doesn't allow you to play any games.  This release consists of a binary
executable for Linux that can load 4K 2600 ROM images and display 1000 frames
of the game.  I'm developing Stella 96 on a 486DX4 100Mhz machine and I'd 
like to see how well it runs on Pentium class machines.  So if you have some
spare time and some ROM images please download the distribution and time it
on your system.  Hopefully, I'll have time to clean up the code and make
a source code distribution before long.  

